# URL patterns the link checker should skip. One regex per line.
#
# Keep this file tight: the whole point of the check is to catch broken
# links, so only add entries for URLs that are intentionally unreachable
# from a CI runner (e.g. future app-store placeholders, auth-gated pages).
#
# Format: https://lychee.cli.rs/docs/usage/configuration/#exclude

# LinkedIn (999) and Reddit (403) refuse automated clients, so their links fail
# from a CI runner whether or not they work for readers.
^https?://([a-z]+\.)?linkedin\.com/
^https?://([a-z]+\.)?reddit\.com/
